  <!-- Internal Links Section -->
  <div class="ed-internal-links">
    <p>
      For complete enrollment rules in plain English, visit our <a href="/medicare/">Medicare education hub</a> — and read our dedicated guide on <a href="/medicare/enrollment">Medicare enrollment windows, deadlines, and how to sign up</a>. To calculate the dollar cost of missing your window, use our <a href="/tools/medicare-late-enrollment-penalty-calculator/">Medicare Part B late enrollment penalty calculator</a>. To find your exact coverage start date once you enroll, use our <a href="/tools/medicare-effective-date-calculator/">Medicare effective date calculator</a>. For drug coverage penalties, see our <a href="/tools/medicare-part-d-late-enrollment-penalty-calculator/">Part D late enrollment penalty tool</a>.
    </p>
